    "description": "The third season of <span class=\"italics\">Shiguang Dailiren</span>.\r<br>\r<br>After the Li Tianchen incident came to a close, Time Photo Studio returned to a superficial peace. However, the news of Xia Fei&#39;s disappearance once again drew everyone into a crossroads of fate. With Vein&#39;s return and Qiao Ling&#39;s awakening of her superpowers, Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang gradually uncover the secrets of the Bahati fire case, and Cheng Xiaoshi&#39;s father, Cheng Weimin, and mother, Shao Yuanyuan, also seem to have intricate connections to it. As the investigation deepens, Liu Xiao from a mysterious organization begins his operation, and the intervention of Yingdu police officer Jae further complicates this pursuit of the truth...\r<br>\r<br>(Source: Bilibili, translated)",
